<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank end-April reserves dip to $11.518 bln.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank end-April reserves dip to $11.518 bln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves at the Czech National Bank (CNB) at the end of April stood at $11.518 billion, down from $11.718 billion at end-march, the CNB said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It added that reserves for the entire banking sector stood at $14.963 billion at end-April, down from $15.231 billion at the end of March.</p>
